-- Tests for Chuong II, Muc 1 (Dieu 15-32). Expected values are read from the cited source lines.
-- Law 139/2025/QH15 does not amend these articles, so the same scenario gives the same answer in
-- every vintage; test `the same in all three vintages` below says so once.

§ `Tests: Chuong II, Muc 1`

§§ `Persons and contracts used throughout`

@@fx `an adult person` : `A person`
@@fx `a minor person` : `A person` ; `is a minor` = TRUE
@@fx `a person who lost capacity` : `A person` ; `has lost civil act capacity` = TRUE
@@fx `a person with difficulty in cognition` : `A person` ; `has difficulty in cognition or in controlling behaviour` = TRUE
@@fx `a person with limited capacity` : `A person` ; `has limited civil act capacity` = TRUE
@@fx `an organisation person` : `A person` ; `is an organisation` = TRUE

@@fx `a property contract` : `A contract of insurance` ; `class of contract` = `a property insurance contract` ; `insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `policyholder` = `an adult person` ; `insured person` = `an adult person`
@@fx `a life contract` : `A contract of insurance` ; `class of contract` = `a life insurance contract` ; `insurer` = `a life insurer` ; `policyholder` = `an adult person` ; `insured person` = `an adult person`
@@fx `a health contract` : `A contract of insurance` ; `class of contract` = `a health insurance contract` ; `insurer` = `a health insurer` ; `policyholder` = `an adult person` ; `insured person` = `an adult person`
@@fx `a group life contract` : `A contract of insurance` ; `class of contract` = `a life insurance contract` ; `insurer` = `a life insurer` ; `policyholder` = `an organisation person` ; `insured person` = `an adult person` ; `is a group contract` = TRUE
@@fx `a maritime contract` : `A contract of insurance` ; `class of contract` = `a property insurance contract` ; `insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `policyholder` = `an adult person` ; `insured person` = `an adult person` ; `is a maritime insurance contract` = TRUE ; `date the contract was made` = YMD 2025 3 10

§§ `Dieu 15`

@@q 370 386
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a life insurance contract` EQUALS `life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a health insurance contract` EQUALS `health insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a property insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a damage insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(1): the type of insurance the class of contract belongs to` `a liability insurance contract` EQUALS `non-life insurance`

-- Dieu 15(2) with Dieu 63(3): a life insurer may add health cover, a non-life insurer may not add life cover.
@@fx `a short term-life product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 12 ; `covers the risk of death` = TRUE ; `is a term-life product` = TRUE
@@fx `a life product of ten years` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `life insurance` ; `term in months` = 120 ; `covers the risk of death` = TRUE
@@fx `a health product of ten years` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `health insurance` ; `term in months` = 120
@@fx `a health product of one year` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `health insurance` ; `term in months` = 12
@@fx `a motor product` : `A product offered` ; `type of insurance` = `non-life insurance` ; `term in months` = 12
@@fx `a life insurer selling life and health` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a life product of ten years`, `a health product of ten years`
@@fx `a non-life insurer selling a life product` : `The business of an insurer` ; `kind of insurer` = `a non-life insurer` ; `products offered` = LIST `a motor product`, `a life product of ten years`
@@fx `a combination of life and health` : `A combination of classes` ; `classes combined` = LIST `a life insurance contract`, `a health insurance contract`
@@fx `no classes combined` : `A combination of classes`

#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `a combination of life and health` `a life insurer selling life and health`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `a combination of life and health` `a non-life insurer selling a life product`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 15(2): the classes combined are consistent with Dieu 63(3)` `no classes combined` `a life insurer selling life and health`)

-- Dieu 15(3)-(4)
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `the Maritime Code`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `this Law`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a maritime contract` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Civil Code`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a property contract` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `this Law`
#ASSERT `Dieu 15(3)-(4): the instrument that governs the matter` `a property contract` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Civil Code`

