@@fx `a late-notice exclusion after force majeure` : `An exclusion clause` ; `the exclusion is for late notice` = TRUE ; `force majeure or an objective obstacle caused the policyholder to notify the insured event late` = TRUE
@@fx `a late-notice exclusion with no excuse` : `An exclusion clause` ; `the exclusion is for late notice` = TRUE
