@@fx `a covered event, refused on an exclusion, explained` : `An insurer's handling of a claim` ; `the event is within the insurer's liability under the contract` = TRUE ; `an exclusion of liability in the contract applies` = TRUE ; `the insurer refused to pay` = TRUE ; `the insurer explained the refusal in writing` = TRUE
