@@fx `a plain claim` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 3 10
@@fx `a plain claim a day late` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 3 11
@@fx `a claim a day before the anniversary` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 3 9
@@fx `a claim with twenty days of force majeure` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `days of force majeure or objective obstacle` = 20 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 3 30
@@fx `the same, a day later` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `days of force majeure or objective obstacle` = 20 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 3 31
@@fx `a claim by someone who proves they did not know` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `the claimant proves they did not know when the insured event occurred` = TRUE ; `date the insured person or beneficiary learned of the insured event` = YMD 2025 5 1 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 5 1
@@fx `a claim that claims to have not known, without proof` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `date the insured person or beneficiary learned of the insured event` = YMD 2025 5 1 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 5 1
@@fx `a liability claim from a third person's demand` : `A claim` ; `date of the insured event` = YMD 2025 3 10 ; `a third person claimed compensation from the policyholder` = TRUE ; `date of the third person's claim` = YMD 2025 8 15 ; `date the claim dossier was submitted` = YMD 2026 8 15
