#ASSERT `Dieu 30: the dossier was submitted in time` `a claim with twenty days of force majeure`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 30: the dossier was submitted in time` `the same, a day later`
#ASSERT `Dieu 30: the dossier was submitted in time` `a claim by someone who proves they did not know`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 30: the dossier was submitted in time` `a claim that claims to have not known, without proof`
#ASSERT `Dieu 30: the dossier was submitted in time` `a liability claim from a third person's demand`

§§ `Dieu 31`

