@@fx `the same paid a day later` : `A claim` ; `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier` = YMD 2025 4 1 ; `date the insurer paid` = YMD 2025 4 17 ; `amount paid late` = 10_000_000 ; `daily interest rate agreed under the Civil Code` = JUST 0.0003
@@fx `the same paid three days later` : `A claim` ; `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier` = YMD 2025 4 1 ; `date the insurer paid` = YMD 2025 4 19 ; `amount paid late` = 10_000_000 ; `daily interest rate agreed under the Civil Code` = JUST 0.0003
@@fx `a late payment with no rate supplied` : `A claim` ; `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier` = YMD 2025 4 1 ; `date the insurer paid` = YMD 2025 4 19 ; `amount paid late` = 10_000_000
@@fx `a claim with thirty days agreed, paid on the thirtieth` : `A claim` ; `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier` = YMD 2025 4 1 ; `days agreed in the contract for payment` = JUST 30 ; `date the insurer paid` = YMD 2025 5 1
@@fx `a claim with thirty days agreed, paid a day after` : `A claim` ; `date the insurer received the full and valid dossier` = YMD 2025 4 1 ; `days agreed in the contract for payment` = JUST 30 ; `date the insurer paid` = YMD 2025 5 2
